1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:19,960
How are you going to reach your father?

2
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:24,320
Sagittarius star is under a total entertainment ban.

3
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,360
I may be the daughter of the Zodiac CEO,

4
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:31,700
but it's impossible for a member of Zero-Zero to move freely throughout the planet.

5
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,600
Okay, what's the plan?

6
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,820
Thank you, Yasunaga.

7
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,640
I'm just happy you're safe and sound, my lady.

8
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,520
Yasuguna has been serving the family since before I was even born.

9
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:52,220
Nice to meet you, Motomiya-sama.

10
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,340
Oh, it's nice to meet you as well.

11
00:00:57,360 --> 00:01:01,460
So this is where Chiyeri was born.

12
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:11,320
Whoa.

13
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:14,440
Your house is incredible.

14
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:16,060
Really?

15
00:01:17,140 --> 00:01:21,600
Miss, I shall do my very best to ensure you see your father.

16
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:23,260
Please relax in the meantime.

17
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:24,720
Very well.

