30
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:58,920
That's Sagittarius star?

31
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:02,060
How are we supposed to find Nagisa and Chieri down there?

32
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:03,420
It won't be easy.

33
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:07,800
I wonder if Chieri came back here to try and settle things with her father.

34
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:10,220
If so, she's being quite reckless.

35
00:03:10,700 --> 00:03:12,420
Zodiac headquarters is like a fortress.

36
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:15,100
We're going to save them, right?

37
00:03:15,900 --> 00:03:18,660
Tsubasa-san is doing her best to make a plan of action.

38
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,420
We'll have to wait a little longer.

39
00:03:20,860 --> 00:03:22,260
Man, I hate this!

40
00:03:22,980 --> 00:03:25,800
Is there really nothing we can do but sit around and wait?

41
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:31,920
The Woda Intelligence Corps are looking for a way into Sagittarius star.

42
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:35,940
Until they can find something, we're on our own.

43
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:38,620
So what are we going to do?

44
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:41,600
You're thinking about taking back Akibasta, right?

45
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:42,700
Mm-hmm.

46
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,880
I'm home.

47
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,540
Sorry for the intrusion.

48
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:58,720
This is your room?

49
00:03:58,880 --> 00:03:59,360
Yes.

50
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:02,020
It's just the way I left it.

51
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,680
Not a thing has changed.

52
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:12,180
Chieri, is it okay if I wait here for a while?

53
00:04:12,180 --> 00:04:19,380
It feels so nice.

54
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:22,120
It's been so long since I've been able to take a bath.

55
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:25,120
It will be some time until I can see my father.

56
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,340
I wonder when he'll show up.

57
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,980
Probably real late, huh?

58
00:04:30,860 --> 00:04:32,180
He won't come here.

59
00:04:32,180 --> 00:04:35,940
I still don't think he ever comes home.

60
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,920
He's always been that way.

61
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:42,800
He didn't come home when my mother died or when my brother died.

62
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,580
Why wouldn't he?

63
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,100
He's too busy with work.

64
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:51,980
I was always all alone in this huge house.

65
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:57,720
I was surrounded by helpers, tutors, and self-defense instructors.

66
00:04:58,140 --> 00:04:59,000
They raised me.

67
00:05:00,180 --> 00:05:00,980
Self-defense?

68
00:05:02,180 --> 00:05:04,300
He wanted a healthy successor.

69
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:06,760
I was supposed to take over the company someday.

70
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:10,180
It must be hard work, being a rich girl.

71
00:05:11,380 --> 00:05:12,260
Oh, wow!

72
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,220
I've never worn anything like this!

73
00:05:17,060 --> 00:05:19,820
Are you sure I can borrow it, Chieri?

74
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:20,420
Yes.

75
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:22,560
I'm having someone wash our clothes.

76
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:24,680
Oh, right.

77
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:28,900
It's already gotten too tight.

78
00:05:32,180 --> 00:05:33,740
It's so quiet.

79
00:05:33,740 --> 00:05:35,900
It's like there's nobody here.

80
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:37,600
It's a cold city, isn't it?

81
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:41,160
This is what planets with total entertainment bans are like.

82
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,580
A total entertainment ban.

83
00:05:43,580 --> 00:05:46,440
How did you find out about Zero-Zero?

84
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:50,320
In a way, it was thanks to my father.

85
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:54,260
My father forgot his tablet at home once.

86
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:59,060
I happened to see a Zero-Zero video he had there.

87
00:05:59,060 --> 00:06:04,320
Even as a child, I vaguely sensed it was something forbidden.

88
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:11,960
But I had Yasunaga gather various Zero-Zero videos and songs for me in secret.

89
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:20,120
Then, as destiny would have it, that summer, my father took me with him on a site inspection.

90
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:22,960
And that was…

91
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:23,440
Yes.

92
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,100
It was Lancaster.

93
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:31,460
What's wrong?

94
00:06:31,660 --> 00:06:33,340
Do you want to buy one, Lord?

95
00:06:34,340 --> 00:06:35,720
We came to eat, too.

96
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:37,980
Do you want me to buy one for you?

97
00:06:38,420 --> 00:06:40,360
It's hard when it's so crowded.

98
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:42,800
Sagittarius star?

99
00:06:43,140 --> 00:06:43,460
Yeah.

100
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,120
Cool!

101
00:06:44,540 --> 00:06:46,940
I've never met a kid from another planet before.

102
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:47,980
Me neither.

103
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:49,080
Yeah!

104
00:06:49,580 --> 00:06:51,620
I've never eaten like this before.

105
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:52,960
It's good.

106
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:56,520
Nagisa and Murumiya, nice to meet you.

107
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:58,420
I'm Yuka Ichijo.

108
00:06:59,280 --> 00:07:00,220
Orine Aira.

109
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,100
I'm Cherry Sono.

110
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:07,240
You were the first friends I'd ever made.

111
00:07:08,460 --> 00:07:11,560
And you were the first person to tell us about AKB.

112
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:13,180
It really was destiny.

113
00:07:13,740 --> 00:07:14,080
Mm-hmm.

114
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,800
You're absolutely certain?

115
00:07:17,220 --> 00:07:17,680
Yes.

116
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:24,460
Just as you were informed, AKB-0048 intends to perform a guerrilla concert on Lancaster.

117
00:07:24,460 --> 00:07:29,220
That was the first time I wanted to become a member of Zero-Zero.

118
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:31,640
Me, too.

119
00:07:32,340 --> 00:07:32,820
But…

120
00:07:32,820 --> 00:07:36,820
After the concert was over…

121
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:37,860
Akarara?

122
00:07:38,860 --> 00:07:41,700
Chieri, did you go to the Zero-Zero concert?

123
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:45,260
I'm sorry, Father, but I…

124
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:49,300
I want to become a member of Zero-Zero.

125
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:54,560
Tell me, Chieri, did Karara glow in response to you?

126
00:07:54,820 --> 00:07:55,180
What?

127
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,340
No, I don't think it did.

128
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:00,360
It's been dim since the concert ended.

129
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:01,380
I see.

130
00:08:01,380 --> 00:08:04,160
Then you do not possess the glow.

131
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,560
Entertainment is forbidden.

132
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:11,620
And AKB-0048 is a group of unlawful terrorists.

133
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:14,560
Don't think of such pointless things.

134
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:15,860
You are my daughter.

135
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:18,740
You are the successor of the Zodiac Corporation.

136
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:25,760
Even after I returned to Sagittarius Star, I continued to plead with my father.

137
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:28,700
He never listened to me.

