166
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:13,120
What does the CEO possibly want with me?

167
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:16,120
I just finished discussing the new Dualium Mining Plan.

168
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:20,120
Since it had your approval, I doubt that's the reason I'm here.

169
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:24,120
Both of us have daughters in AKB-0048.

170
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:26,120
I thought that we should meet.

171
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:31,120
Furthermore, I found the report you submitted to the Entertainment Administration Bureau.

172
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:35,120
The relationship between entertainment and work efficiency, quite interesting.

173
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:37,120
How do you know about that?

174
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:41,120
Planets which allow entertainment are found to have a higher labor efficiency rating

175
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:44,120
than those with even partial entertainment bands.

176
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:47,120
It was an interesting observation on your part.

177
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:50,120
It's the truth, grounded in hard-researched facts.

178
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:54,120
In other words, you believe we should free entertainment?

179
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:57,120
I think we should investigate the possibility, yes.

180
00:10:58,120 --> 00:11:01,120
Look for the door that cannot be seen.

181
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:04,120
The secret stairs are right beside them.

182
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:07,120
First, oppression, then liberation.

183
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:09,120
And once that's happened,

184
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:13,120
well, we may have our very own wonderland.

185
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:19,120
I have one good memory with my father.

186
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:21,120
What is it?

187
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:24,120
After I sang in front of his room,

188
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:27,120
my father took me to bed when I fell asleep.

189
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:30,120
I still remember that warmth.

190
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:35,120
The next day when I asked Yasnagat,

191
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:40,120
he said he found me in the hallway and put me to bed.

192
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:42,120
But I knew...

193
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:47,120
I knew that my father was the one who carried me.

194
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:50,120
And if that's really the case...

195
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:53,120
Nagisa!

196
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:55,120
The Zodiac SP!

197
00:11:55,120 --> 00:12:02,120
I'm sorry, Miss Chiari, but we must restrain the both of you for the time being.

198
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:04,120
What's going on?

199
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:06,120
It was your father's orders, ma'am.

200
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:08,120
Yasnagat!

201
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:11,120
I'm sorry, my lady, but I've kept my promise.

202
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:14,120
I will take you to see your father now.

203
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:22,120
The dualium crystals on that planet responded to the members

204
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:25,120
and strengthened the Kiraras in the process.

205
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,120
As fate would have it,

206
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:30,120
a massive quantity of dualium is buried beneath Akibastar.

207
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:33,120
We will warp underground using the Kirara drive

208
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:35,120
and create a reaction with the dualium.

209
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,120
Okay.

210
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:40,120
But can we really warp to a location with that much accuracy?

211
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:43,120
It's possible if we synchronize this crystal.

212
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:47,120
So we're gonna use the dualium crystal Orine got from the Fungis?

213
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:49,120
Even if we make it in,

214
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:52,120
there's no guarantee we can create a strong enough reaction.

215
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,120
It's impossible.

216
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:57,120
That is, unless all of you are able to achieve Centanova Class Glows

217
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,120
once we get started.

218
00:12:58,120 --> 00:13:01,120
But then how are we supposed to do that?

219
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:05,120
That settles it. They're crazy.

220
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:09,120
Agreed. But it seems like something Nagisa would do.

221
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:11,120
Oh, totally. Chiari, too.

222
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:14,120
They're both off their rockers.

223
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:17,120
Maybe that's why the two of them shine so brightly.

224
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:20,120
You're right. They're always walking ahead of us.

225
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:22,120
Even if it's crazy or impossible,

226
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:25,120
they do what they can to make their dreams come true.

227
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,120
Pretty inspiring, isn't it?

228
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:29,120
You okay?

229
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:35,120
Yes, I'm fine. I just may have been overthinking things a little bit.

230
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:38,120
But can such reckless girls become the Centanova?

231
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:40,120
The Centanova?

232
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,120
I don't want to lose.

233
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:46,120
I don't want to lose to either of them.

234
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:50,120
Neither do I! I want to shine brighter than ever before!

235
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:55,120
The details of our plan to take back Akiba's star have been established.

236
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,120
I'll explain that …

237
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,120
Tsubasa-san!

238
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:59,120
Yukiri, what is it?

239
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:03,120
We've been contacted by Koji Haru on Akiba's star. Tsubasa-san!

240
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:06,120
Send it through the monitor.

241
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,120
Roger!

242
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:11,120
Hey there! Long time no see, ladies!

243
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:13,120
Good to see you!

244
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:24,120
Your father wishes to speak with you, Miss Chieri.

245
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:26,120
Hello, daughter.

246
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:28,120
What do you think you're doing?

247
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:32,120
Is that how a daughter should speak to her father at their reunion?

248
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:35,120
I think you'd at least be grateful for my protection.

249
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:40,120
I have watched everything you've done lately.

250
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:44,120
Honestly, I never imagined you had so much hidden talent.

251
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:47,120
You have begun to shine.

252
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:51,120
You made me popular because you recognized my potential.

253
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:54,120
In order to make me the Centanova and use me.

254
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:56,120
Use you?

255
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,120
Take a look.

256
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:59,120
The Flying Get!

257
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:04,120
They're waiting just outside Sagittarius Star's defensive line.

258
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:08,120
I can order a DES attack and finish them off for good.

259
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,120
No, don't!

260
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:11,120
There's no need for that.

261
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,120
I'll give you what you want.

262
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,120
Oh?

263
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:16,120
I will become the Centanova, okay?

264
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:21,120
Just promise that you won't hurt Nagisa or the rest of Zero Zero anymore!

265
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,120
What?

266
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:24,120
Very well.

267
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:26,120
Come.

268
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:29,120
Show me your shine, my daughter.

269
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:31,120
This is crazy, Chiarie! Don't go!

270
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:35,120
